  Slug: gunslinger-s-way
  DisplayName: Gunslinger's Way
  IconPath: icons/magic/symbols/question-stone-yellow.webp
  Description: All gunslingers have a particular way they follow, a combination of
    philosophy and combat style that defines both how they fight and the weapons
    they excel with. At 1st level, your way grants you an initial deed, a unique
    reload action called a slinger's reload, and proficiency with a particular skill.
    You also gain advanced and greater deeds at later levels, as well as access to
    way-specific feats. @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.Way of the Drifter]
    You wander across the battlefield, equally at home in and out of the fray. @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.Way
    of the Pistolero] You carefully maintain your distance at a duelist's 10 paces
    with pistol in hand. @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.Way of the Sniper]
    You practice a methodical style of shooting, striking from far cover. @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.Way
    of the Vanguard] You rely on a brutal combat style that uses heavy weapons and
    explosive attacks. @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.classfeatures.Item.Way of the Triggerbrand]
    You prefer firearms that work well as weapons in both melee and ranged combat
